WEBVTT

00:17:28.619 --> 00:17:30.841
That was, like,
we considered that super cool.

00:17:30.865 --> 00:17:31.871
(Laughter)

00:17:31.895 --> 00:17:33.392
CA: Is it unrealistic for them

00:17:33.416 --> 00:17:38.156
to hope or think that that child
loves them, as some might, as most, wish?

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.414
TG: Well, I tell you,
that child will be loyal,

00:17:40.438 --> 00:17:43.813
and if your house is burning down,
they're going to get you out of it.

00:17:43.837 --> 00:17:47.496
CA: Wow. So most people, if you ask them
what they're most passionate about,

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:50.368
they'd say things like,
"My kids" or "My lover."

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:52.762
What are you most passionate about?

00:17:52.786 --> 00:17:55.817
TG: I'm passionate
about that the things I do

00:17:55.841 --> 00:17:57.878
are going to make
the world a better place.

00:17:57.902 --> 00:18:00.124
When I have a mother
of an autistic child say,